4504880","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v0.1.0f8","summary":"• Adjusted: First-clear rewards for certain stages.• Adjusted: Reforge chances and the effects of materials from different regions.• Fixed: Occasional issues causing battles, transitions, or campfire activities to get stuck.• Fixed: Various UI display and interaction issues.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:32:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041841","verified_at":"2026-10-25T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504880-1846651706691764","game_id":"steam-4504880","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v0.1.0f7","summary":"Changed: Various UI icons and interactions.Changed: The display order of feature unlock notifications, which can now also appear while the inventory is open.Changed: Reduced the delay before Milestone reward windows appear.Fixed: Some equipment affix values not matching the equipment level. Existing affixes below their intended minimum values have also been corrected.Fixed: Some equipment effect descriptions not displaying correctly.Fixed: Equipment info panels jittering near screen edges or ext","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:24:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691764","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:29:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504880-1846651706689516","game_id":"steam-4504880","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v0.1.0f1 - v0.1.0f6","summary":"v0.1.0f1Added: UI scaling and extended info window settings.Changed: Layout and positioning of equipment comparison panels.Changed: Reforged equipment details and result previews.Fixed: Icon display issues in synthesis and reforging.Fixed: Layout and stat icon issues in special stage info.Fixed: Meat upgrade sound effects and star display layering.Fixed: Issues with launching automatically at system startup.v0.1.0f2Added: Try clicking on Sirius!Added: A mute toggle.Changed: Individual countdown ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:56:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:29:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504880-1846651706688571","game_id":"steam-4504880","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Out Now! Sirius Is Here!","summary":"Thanks for waiting! Download the ［Demo］ on Steam and enjoy some desktop time with Sirius!Enjoying the game? Remember to follow and add it to your wishlist!If you have any issues to report or suggestions to share, let us know through our ［Feedback Form］.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:19:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688571","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:29:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504880-1846018067944130","game_id":"steam-4504880","kind":"announcement","title":"Sirius Is Coming to Your Desktop for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone! We're O.Z.D.K, and this is our first announcement here on Steam. A huge thank you to everyone who's been following the game! Since our store page went live in June, we've been refining the game. We're excited to announce that our demo will launch during Steam Next Fest this October! Oct 19 (Mon) 10:00 PDT In the demo, you'll join Sirius on an adventure through the Forest, with 20 map nodes to explore, 20 weapons across 3 weapon types, and a total of 19 gear and cosmetic items to di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:03:25Z","time_precision":"minute"